# The app verifies media/ registry files against SHA-256 digests in
# media/registry-index.json. Digests are computed over LF bytes (what GitHub
# Pages serves), so keep these files LF everywhere — including Windows worktrees.
#
# The ** patterns matter: a plain media/*.js does not match the canonical
# sources in media/identifiers/, which is where they have lived since the
# 2026-08 split.
media/**/*.js text eol=lf
media/**/*.json text eol=lf
media/*.js text eol=lf
media/*.json text eol=lf
